    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-7ad56342-ce5b-4367-84ff-865c2b854bca" n="0746" facs="#m-2548c357-977d-4027-af49-71d7e6fb124e" /><div xml:id="m-0df78f8f-9fac-405f-b32c-f2c935d8a4a7">
            <lg xml:id="m-a3805c2b-d135-44eb-97b4-80c46e0a9012">
              <l xml:id="m-d758e8da-e5f7-4131-8ef0-92a83e33dfd6" facs="#m-23232343-a887-4dec-81bd-596113e44340" label="ambiguous">soo</l><l xml:id="m-603fe138-7358-4188-81b3-111e0814ec55" facs="#m-f9b74298-8904-45e1-b7a9-6b16f11e2a6e" label="text-like">Second Sunday of the Passion</l><l xml:id="m-e2a6c165-1c68-41af-bf38-1b4a2b0c5502" facs="#m-f6fdcbcb-b082-479b-8e89-81cf2ced3f2e" label="lyrics-like">negábis. Et egréssus foras, flevit</l><l xml:id="m-ca2d7b7f-983a-4beb-b713-97adb9b9d238" facs="#m-bfc4a094-9dc5-44c9-a438-7d75d79333bc" label="lyrics-like">et dixérunt: S. Hic dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-db065873-a09e-46ae-96a3-af2794519fb7" facs="#m-57df8848-909c-4277-acac-3ed2d540dcf7" label="ambiguous">Possum destruere templum Dei,</l><l xml:id="m-9137473b-393e-4352-b529-c4cdaed08e21" facs="#m-ae653c9b-3635-428d-8fb4-1aa0bb2b2479" label="lyrics-like">amáre.</l><l xml:id="m-6b1028a9-3a90-46f9-b4d5-df97d3ced2ce" facs="#m-4f525c39-4b6a-4cab-8700-76bf88dd63df" label="ambiguous">Mane autem facto, consslium</l><l xml:id="m-be821dfe-9b9d-47c7-9688-c60e68d2a68c" facs="#m-1cab90da-4332-4464-9482-5cbc4c3eb2eb" label="ambiguous">et post triduum reaedificare illud.</l><l xml:id="m-5a6ce592-5c39-4d9a-898c-b338ba36ebf3" facs="#m-5452a361-455b-43d2-b268-31d4b673b0a1" label="lyrics-like">iniérunt omnes principes sacer¬</l><l xml:id="m-254d90d2-73ce-4963-9068-9b7ecc0f4198" facs="#m-cb046a87-8ac3-42b7-9fb3-f4bfc270267e" label="lyrics-like">C. Et surgens princeps sacerdó¬</l><l xml:id="m-53394cab-99cf-4775-aac1-c5977b63c89e" facs="#m-cd505cc3-a7ec-4007-a03d-9052c4a697aa" label="lyrics-like">dótum, et seniórès pópuli advér¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee986980-7621-4434-953a-71aa4b4cd189" facs="#m-13509464-2f73-44ef-ae21-14b784a166e1" label="lyrics-like">tum, ait illi : S. Nihil respóndes</l><l xml:id="m-61d50c0a-8f90-4c4c-825b-0566a4df5fd9" facs="#m-e285e477-caa9-43a5-b6c8-423c4a92dd9f" label="lyrics-like">sus Jesum, ut eum morti tráde¬</l><l xml:id="m-9dcfe641-4293-456a-9b95-faff49fa5f13" facs="#m-cd941750-1558-4296-9148-790c13bb6d5e" label="lyrics-like">ad ea, quae isti advérsum te</l><l xml:id="m-401612a5-e7e8-4c02-937e-329a0868a6a7" facs="#m-a631ae7f-0344-42f7-9d7e-ebd95731abdc" label="lyrics-like">testificántur? C. Jesus autem</l><l xml:id="m-f5f6c8a5-bc1e-44fa-9a3f-01d4f4bce01e" facs="#m-df29204f-914c-4def-925d-388a5f0f9b03" label="lyrics-like">rent. Et vinctum adduxérunt</l><l xml:id="m-a05ccf81-36cb-496e-a052-71f580acd18c" facs="#m-83fecfb2-acbf-46ae-b67b-46aec6cc117b" label="lyrics-like">eum, et tradidérunt Póntio Pi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4f264fec-3cf6-43fd-a9ca-200ce56ac503" facs="#m-813210a0-0dbd-440a-9863-3a36917c007c" label="lyrics-like">tacébat. Et princeps sacerdótum</l><l xml:id="m-f1979381-2d82-49e9-88e6-841ce9232fd0" facs="#m-24e7cbff-d9ee-4bb7-85ec-a07a45859b7f" label="lyrics-like">láto praésidi. Tunc videns Judas,</l><l xml:id="m-754874fc-b440-4851-966b-9407f35593a5" facs="#m-5b7b722b-9591-41a3-8022-c19a13603c06" label="lyrics-like">ait illi : S. Adjúrõ te per Deum</l><l xml:id="m-6383962b-ab91-494e-9bfe-08cd00058d43" facs="#m-431610a4-1a55-43ae-80d0-2c7cbace654a" label="lyrics-like">qui eum trádidit, quod damnátus</l><l xml:id="m-de0b520d-3f14-4855-9f95-60d1125c89d1" facs="#m-ee5e9e0b-4bbc-4c2a-a2e9-af49bb01d8b2" label="ambiguous">vivum, ut dicas nobis, si tu es</l><l xml:id="m-7fbc0b77-1372-4896-8226-798c1a76ee87" facs="#m-9c37de1d-5fff-4bf7-8a9b-6eb3b5b1343c" label="lyrics-like">esset, paeniténtia ductus, rétulit</l><l xml:id="m-3df8d788-e9e0-43d5-8158-5a5e13586537" facs="#m-dbd588ea-80a9-4268-abc3-9f94ca0a1413" label="ambiguous">Christus Filius Dei. C. Dicit illi</l><l xml:id="m-774eed0a-eaae-4cf1-908c-2aa85e94b8a7" facs="#m-39a612c5-b0d0-4f0a-bba1-08cf605dee8d" label="lyrics-like">Jesus: ★ Tu dixísti. Verúmta¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ea0eef5-9260-43f9-bea3-4c9dccf34bf2" facs="#m-0608d3ac-f3fa-46d9-b7b6-ba39a673bed3" label="lyrics-like">triginta argénteos principibus</l><l xml:id="m-6f04e6a1-f588-42e4-8e3d-b576511e21b4" facs="#m-43f6a49b-8eef-4b34-8cb9-314d0ea168d9" label="lyrics-like">men dico vobis, ámodo vidébitis</l><l xml:id="m-f18e753a-949e-4791-9e44-4db04363b72b" facs="#m-f035e712-9959-4060-bdfe-161378b21f2f" label="lyrics-like">sacerdótum, et senióribus, di¬</l><l xml:id="m-dda41b89-c860-4eae-a872-b381bc7a9527" facs="#m-3063b3e3-d0f0-4b3b-a1ec-5cfc04abc805" label="lyrics-like">cens: S. Peccávis tradens sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-151a8137-49ab-4444-854e-a0495eb4ebce" facs="#m-9f61ea52-3e97-4e10-8a81-0e4968390247" label="lyrics-like">Filium hóminis sedéntem a dex¬</l><l xml:id="m-64d09d4b-47b0-440b-b2b7-ba940d3d83e9" facs="#m-11659490-c387-4ca3-b7f0-b221169aeef4" label="lyrics-like">tris virtútis Dei, et veniéntem</l><l xml:id="m-0460b3f7-b918-4410-a7ef-53e252845afa" facs="#m-ce07f16d-6e8c-4154-9ad3-f1cc4670266b" label="lyrics-like">guinem justum. C. At illi dixé¬</l><l xml:id="m-051fd647-f4fd-4cbc-bb45-3252cce9b503" facs="#m-89ad1c6f-d1a0-4345-a585-4274def691b1" label="lyrics-like">in núbibus caeli. C. Tunc prin¬</l><l xml:id="m-dc97ed09-a114-4f00-b389-2c8c09bbfb76" facs="#m-f8fc2f3b-3efc-43e5-8006-36e44f4fc749" label="ambiguous">runt: S. Quid ad nos? Tu</l><l xml:id="m-a2f9bfe6-7a6c-447a-8b9a-24c67da72c37" facs="#m-0c8527f0-0974-4854-97d7-052f53b25867" label="lyrics-like">ceps sacerdótum scidit vesti¬</l><l xml:id="m-74ccad54-dcc0-404f-b835-f51ddf17b442" facs="#m-0a492bc2-3381-4940-9fb0-0e563b7f7e51" label="lyrics-like">videris. C. Et projéctis argénteis</l><l xml:id="m-f56b4022-d02c-4081-a36b-20a7c5f4e4e5" facs="#m-a05a2d86-964e-4376-bed4-80bcf5c32374" label="lyrics-like">in templo, recéssit : et ábiens,</l><l xml:id="m-794cb66e-e074-48d6-81df-0eb22fab2742" facs="#m-7e86ed3b-7421-41d5-9d25-ee7a93faa375" label="lyrics-like">ménta sua, dicens: S. Blasphe¬</l><l xml:id="m-d87e72b3-6c65-4b05-b25e-995dd3955482" facs="#m-f161c671-6191-48e4-9ae3-a1bf58465a01" label="lyrics-like">mávit: quid adhuc egémus</l><l xml:id="m-d1a33560-936b-4c96-9c63-6882d63dd29e" facs="#m-edef1d5a-81bb-48a8-aa77-f0608f9c85f5" label="lyrics-like">láqueo se suspéndit. Principes</l><l xml:id="m-23b8e833-4d08-4ec5-9efa-4db85ae3e94c" facs="#m-fd33b1a2-6ca5-4eb2-a898-c895d5581ba9" label="lyrics-like">téstibus? Ecce nunc audistis</l><l xml:id="m-cd5a7dc6-b4e5-499a-bd14-77361da7d553" facs="#m-ff82d532-0293-45cb-ab57-3c95d3e43738" label="lyrics-like">autem sacerdótum, accéptis ar¬</l><l xml:id="m-b2937ada-fbfd-4adf-a5bd-37d0f484f8bc" facs="#m-fd901ecf-eaec-4d66-a0b6-6396397ef89f" label="lyrics-like">blasphémiam: quid vobis vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-57577e17-384d-4e53-afd9-9be8f914b9cd" facs="#m-44bf2567-b8c2-45a7-88b6-2722cceb3c91" label="lyrics-like">génteis, dixérunt: S. Non licet</l><l xml:id="m-073603b0-9f89-46f4-8738-f5da5572d3f1" facs="#m-9c4115cb-78f0-4f22-a6b0-4e5c6864bc57" label="lyrics-like">détur? C. At illi respondéntes</l><l xml:id="m-5ba22724-a380-40c8-9bf3-99c70d3ea31d" facs="#m-79590d33-a1e0-4aac-9381-2e81e4192575" label="lyrics-like">eos mittere in córbonam: quia</l><l xml:id="m-c6870a8a-ec7a-49e3-8fbe-6983102ebeb3" facs="#m-c30feabf-03af-48a8-93cb-a46b11e59cc8" label="lyrics-like">prétium sánguinis est. C. Con¬</l><l xml:id="m-db35f29c-2922-4abd-808c-c041dbddb589" facs="#m-a69b4885-2aef-4800-bac9-6fbab7b198e5" label="lyrics-like">dixérunt : S. Reus est mortis.</l><l xml:id="m-302b8ee2-eaf6-4127-b67a-3f67e5ff98ca" facs="#m-aba32e86-07e2-47e7-b1a7-9d509adaaf69" label="lyrics-like">C. Tunc exspuérunt in fáciem</l><l xml:id="m-d25a10c5-169f-4c25-9069-2e1cb8250acc" facs="#m-98f4a540-3b9f-4b97-b2d4-78596eb4f030" label="lyrics-like">silio autem inito, emérunt ex</l><l xml:id="m-cc2e4d50-2742-4615-b797-f6482a75eac0" facs="#m-b0a121a3-2561-47bd-bc5f-95944aa16748" label="lyrics-like">ejus, et cólaphis eum cecidérunt,</l><l xml:id="m-d1056ea5-e5b3-43ff-8c4d-38087ab40ffb" facs="#m-6e1f85e7-8733-4430-a32c-94de3ad5b110" label="lyrics-like">illis agrum fíguli, in sepultúram</l><l xml:id="m-6c2b9ff2-d5d0-4f3d-91ce-15492c61dea4" facs="#m-7293e5ec-90b5-4fe1-88d5-8847c11a0146" label="lyrics-like">peregrinórum. Propter hoc vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-2eb716ef-7024-48a4-92ef-4fdf1ec644fa" facs="#m-64a3e46c-638b-4f01-aaa2-a826037271f2" label="lyrics-like">álii autem palmas in fáciem</l><l xml:id="m-a88f5613-c147-4c20-80d0-248af3dd433c" facs="#m-452e88f7-3335-41db-a5ad-286a88999f4e" label="lyrics-like">ejus dedérunt, dicéntes : S. Pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d8400cc-ed07-40ea-a685-bbf550c31bb1" facs="#m-70acdfcf-3103-4384-8a76-57b3d7f780c6" label="lyrics-like">cátus est ager ille, Hacéldama,</l><l xml:id="m-c2ff8eb8-1a30-46b0-8ade-1448d423be1d" facs="#m-82ecee7c-1c4b-464e-9d15-e75b93b10488" label="ambiguous">phetiza nobis, Christe, quis est</l><l xml:id="m-0a64e7f2-5a52-4d93-9667-c1303f36b959" facs="#m-5f1aef00-5cf3-4feb-9f29-0d3eac40949a" label="lyrics-like">hoc est, ager sánguinis, usque</l><l xml:id="m-ca47beff-0a65-432b-8bd5-601b911403f9" facs="#m-a6d3ce7c-399f-45af-80dd-0ba8ec48cb98" label="lyrics-like">in hodiérnum diem. Tunc implé¬</l><l xml:id="m-17eff2e9-ad1f-4faa-9d25-c49bcf5c014c" facs="#m-1fcfb453-c6ca-4750-9621-15d3b311fe56" label="lyrics-like">qui te percússit? C. Petrus vero</l><l xml:id="m-069f6aa8-36bb-4282-b1e4-8dcc6b88cba4" facs="#m-80b6b602-8413-4615-844b-994252444559" label="ambiguous">tum est, quod dictum est per</l><l xml:id="m-224ac84e-aeff-4855-a327-fe0844b90341" facs="#m-f4eba251-6f1d-405d-b98f-338ebb12707c" label="lyrics-like">sedébat foris in átrio: et accéssit</l><l xml:id="m-3e92367b-8490-4346-b8d7-72664318c7c8" facs="#m-d2bfff0d-0689-4ad8-b04e-5ab7902bc538" label="lyrics-like">Jeremíam prophétam, dicéntem:</l><l xml:id="m-b8b61983-bc1a-46d7-bf2e-bc3df27f3756" facs="#m-b63b80b2-459e-434f-aeab-5e2c027bbb17" label="ambiguous">ad eum una ancilla, dicens :S. Et</l><l xml:id="m-aa96b928-8a31-4dcf-ab56-04f788241d94" facs="#m-9eb3ae36-6d7a-4e64-8a54-a4032147b8ec" label="lyrics-like">tu cum Jesu Galilaéo eras. C. At</l><l xml:id="m-81229288-7574-4e76-b80f-424e8a5c9698" facs="#m-d423dc91-be78-48b2-a350-b4aa4c9367ff" label="lyrics-like">Et accepérunt triginta argénteos,</l><l xml:id="m-72c92c88-eb71-4537-b2fc-ec550b5379f6" facs="#m-91cbe224-7d79-45fd-b797-65cd2c34895c" label="lyrics-like">ille negávit coram ómnibus, di¬</l><l xml:id="m-93e551cc-b58a-4008-8a8b-6735a638cf3b" facs="#m-e7cef1a0-f909-4dc6-b2f8-db2b425de89d" label="lyrics-like">prétium appretiáti, quem appre¬</l><l xml:id="m-c284d54c-8ae7-4eea-a2dc-a0d25ef2c14c" facs="#m-d740164a-5f94-4fa3-8f63-20b5d9841fdf" label="lyrics-like">tiavérunt a filiis Israël: et</l><l xml:id="m-3739c061-627f-4da5-a503-55bc36c7e621" facs="#m-0b831b95-5327-4164-8810-b628b555d697" label="lyrics-like">cens: S. Néscio quid dicis.</l><l xml:id="m-632382e6-efa3-4eb8-a886-6de600fb08dc" facs="#m-e516ef22-f73d-4e7f-85bd-35651dd62909" label="lyrics-like">C. Exeúnte autem illo jánuam,</l><l xml:id="m-0d6fcd47-6f0e-407f-979b-7206ebb0c81c" facs="#m-c27111f8-f1c2-47a2-a147-7572b38b26a3" label="lyrics-like">dedérunt eos in agrum figuli,</l><l xml:id="m-86625811-3454-4d28-9292-5ae7ee668836" facs="#m-e891e44e-3ef1-4d6b-86e5-80a1170dac0e" label="lyrics-like">vidit eum ália ancilla, et ait</l><l xml:id="m-8cb64d3f-c60c-4f70-9d9e-a21800713dfe" facs="#m-8f68e0be-aaf0-4bd1-8a35-479512da4a4a" label="lyrics-like">sicut constituit mihi Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-4358c2c3-2e27-4dc7-8dfd-48434280c790" facs="#m-a3cf4c03-d116-4f3d-927f-81953723aa5f" label="lyrics-like">Jesus autem stetit ante praé¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d4b98e3-86b6-41e9-b3ee-fccce40d5365" facs="#m-21232d3d-a882-4639-9485-a8059a16413d" label="ambiguous">his, qui erant ibi: S. Et hic</l><l xml:id="m-3c19c3b1-36ec-4436-b8b6-fcf962e1afac" facs="#m-a9bd4c6b-0609-420d-b5e9-5438e9124d73" label="lyrics-like">erat cum Jesu Nazaréno. C. Et</l><l xml:id="m-71391843-bb82-4081-8fff-6d11168d1cb7" facs="#m-93362128-d82c-48aa-bb83-7eb7ba7cf7a6" label="lyrics-like">sidem, et interrogávit eum prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-314ed6a6-1f2b-4f94-bdb3-163b403699e0" facs="#m-f9f29f3f-0946-4a80-9e9e-978eb923adef" label="ambiguous">ses, dicens: S. Tu es Rex</l><l xml:id="m-5c28d825-10ce-41c8-8d25-f73ec831c92c" facs="#m-11b03124-81fb-4cac-a753-e3eb484b0854" label="lyrics-like">iterum negávit cum juraménto:</l><l xml:id="m-7a1d8098-8d28-424e-9fdb-6a72d389a42e" facs="#m-97cbb9ae-31ab-4d91-9519-070c9daebe09" label="lyrics-like">Judacórum? C. Dicit illi Jesus:</l><l xml:id="m-2e3721eb-035d-40d1-a280-4d866160528d" facs="#m-5557746f-e311-435c-ae6e-2b3e7160b813" label="lyrics-like">Quia non novi hóminem. Et</l><l xml:id="m-464b043c-31d2-4130-af4e-301aacb5bc04" facs="#m-7315c045-da14-4ad2-b2c2-d270106fbabb" label="ambiguous">★ Tu dicis. C. Et cum accusa¬</l><l xml:id="m-4bdf76b9-cb1e-4d38-a0b3-e03dc6d9ecdf" facs="#m-8c7698a3-619e-4dee-91b2-8868f7807915" label="lyrics-like">post pusillum accessérunt qui</l><l xml:id="m-615b7a7d-5802-40dd-9405-ad2097376c49" facs="#m-f136dfc0-1f07-4ae5-b1c8-dce167790806" label="lyrics-like">stabant, et dixérunt Petro</l><l xml:id="m-5803a3a3-bf52-46e2-a17a-dc7b2b202a88" facs="#m-9031a86c-7cfc-4c06-b20a-c4cc1f80d022" label="lyrics-like">rétur a principibus sacerdótum,</l><l xml:id="m-14f93da8-56d0-4bbc-8c20-d0b9fe3a62bd" facs="#m-168a396d-d73c-4759-9427-02ec9f088b26" label="ambiguous">S. Vere et tu ex illis es : nam</l><l xml:id="m-474cc7ed-d258-420b-a5c8-72220604b13d" facs="#m-b20686ba-5796-48f7-8dce-03318eadb7b6" label="lyrics-like">et senióribus, nihil respóndit.</l><l xml:id="m-d16cb5d5-5599-4372-9b7f-b14562aabf97" facs="#m-b013bb73-e1fa-4d38-ba26-3e892a26366b" label="ambiguous">Tunc dicit illi Pilatus: N</l><l xml:id="m-201e415c-23de-4f57-8a74-47f0a29799e1" facs="#m-6aac5507-6662-4d03-8093-7376efcb6266" label="lyrics-like">et loquéla tua maniféstum te</l><l xml:id="m-3da914b8-4835-44f6-a203-bc55114e274a" facs="#m-7f4a7040-a1ab-40ed-a405-0297a68e0d99" label="lyrics-like">facit. C. Tunc coepit detestári,</l><l xml:id="m-c4168ce1-e1fd-448f-8bf1-ee0dd92c55b6" facs="#m-68a6ee77-24dd-4c39-a9a2-77aaa5375566" label="lyrics-like">audis quanta advérsum te di¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8542989-7593-4661-aff8-7d0c6a5936da" facs="#m-d35fe497-c70a-4719-9ea2-5e603f6769d5" label="lyrics-like">cunt testimónia? C. Et non</l><l xml:id="m-8930a28b-0f44-405b-ad1c-c0ac871ab618" facs="#m-315e9d70-a1bf-4b00-b1fc-9bab1fc7ccdc" label="lyrics-like">et juráre quia non novísset</l><l xml:id="m-ab67ff90-9b46-4d94-bc60-c46a3196ad7a" facs="#m-c7b56865-6678-45bc-8a71-76fd92b9b3cf" label="lyrics-like">respóndit ei ad ullum verbum,</l><l xml:id="m-ce71457f-356d-4af4-b596-922cbee6d00e" facs="#m-58f52485-c08c-4005-b630-d5168cca783d" label="lyrics-like">hóminem. Et contínuo gallus</l><l xml:id="m-e9ded3c1-8a7e-4834-b876-f98b84f664c1" facs="#m-35f440a1-4036-4f89-a642-7db96cfd67ca" label="lyrics-like">cantávit. Et recordátus est Pe¬</l><l xml:id="m-894c4f55-1b08-4007-93b9-fd5770b1c5b8" facs="#m-b9feaf61-9068-42de-88e5-e8922dafd127" label="lyrics-like">ita ut mirarétur praeses vehe¬</l><l xml:id="m-649e37a2-c0c6-4b88-9899-ad7abadb7c95" facs="#m-b41d5b36-93de-4b32-bd63-558e3a509bae" label="lyrics-like">ménter. Per diem autem solém¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ba8ed6a-5e3d-4e23-a1e5-6a27cdbcf572" facs="#m-7f8d4c6d-6f52-4722-b28a-181d77910ae8" label="ambiguous">trus verbi Jesu, quod dixerat:</l><l xml:id="m-14891c85-d76c-488d-8d67-e1c5c5cb0692" facs="#m-9afc64f4-4814-43a0-8b0d-96a8d24aaa8a" label="lyrics-like">Priúsquam gallus cantet, ter mel nem consuéverat praeses pópulo</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>